  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Our Clipped Council liaison came by today, and a well-placed bribe ensured I won't have to be sharing a room with the others. No more worrying about late-night visits. Next, I sent word to my man outside the village; he is to deliver a message of great importance.",
    "value": "今日，我们的断翅议会联络员到访，一笔恰到好处的贿赂确保了我无需再与他人同宿。自此，不必再忧心深夜的不速之客了。随后，我向我安插在村外的人传递了消息；他将去送达一份至关重要的信息。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Then, our mental training began. I outclassed the others with ease, as I knew I would. My mind is the sharpest it has ever been. I could see them staring at me, angrily, just willing me to succeed, planning what they'd do to me when I did. They're going to have a rude awakening.",
    "value": "之后，我们的精神历练开始了。我轻而易举地凌驾于众人之上，正如我所预料。我的思绪从未如此敏锐。我能看到他们怒视着我，一面巴望着我成功，一面盘算着待我成功之时要如何对付我。他们终将迎来一场无知的觉醒。"
  }
]